# .dolores/prompts — prompt versions, one directory per key, one file per version.
#
# Key:     a.b.c   (dotted; dsh-compatible)
# Dir:     a-b-c/  (dots become hyphens; segments never contain hyphens)
# Version: <version>.md
# Active:  a pointer in ../configs/prompts.yml, never the filename.
#
# The manager (mindset/prompter.py) is the contract; this file only sets the tracking policy.
# Tracked: *.md. Ignored: drafts and scratch.
*.tmp
*.bak
drafts/
